OL,3,GNEWSAPrayer vigil held after four arson
OL,4,Aattack murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have attended a
OL,7,Fprayer vigil in Waterford for four
OL,8,Fmembers of the same family who were
OL,9,Fkilled in an arson attack in the city.
OL,11,FKim English, Philip English and two of
OL,12,Ftheir children - nine-year-old Jayden
OL,13,Fand 12-year-old Callum - died after
OL,14,Ftheir home in Birch Avenue was set on
OL,15,Ffire on Tuesday.
OL,17,FThe vigil took place at the Sacred
OL,18,FHeart Church on Wednesday and the
OL,19,Fservice included prayers, songs and
OL,20,Fmemories of the deceased.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
