OL,3,GNEWSAPrayer vigil held after four arson
OL,4,Aattack murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FGardai (Irish police) said "multiple
OL,7,Fsearches" were conducted on Tuesday
OL,8,Fevening and vehicles and electronic
OL,9,Fdevices have been seized for technical
OL,10,Fexamination.
